80 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmenu-contact-bg.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmenu-contact-bg.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmenu-contact-bg.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=80 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmenu-contact-bg.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmenu-contact-bg.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div></ul></nav></div><main class=""><section class="page-hero-sec"><div class="parallax-container" data-height="100%"><span class="img-disc-text">Actual Site Photo*</span><div class="parallax-wrapper" style="height:100%"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="About Nyati Group" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="banner-image" style="color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=100 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=100 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=100 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=100 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=100 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fwho-we-are.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=100"/></div></div></div><div class="inner-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12"><div class="content-wrapper"><h1 class="title-text"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">A</span><span class="char">b</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">u</span><span class="char">t</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">N</span><span class="char">y</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">t</span><span class="char">i</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">G</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">u</span><span class="char">p</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h1></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="about-intro-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 text-center"><div class="sec--title-wrapper"><h2 class="sec--main-title"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">W</span><span class="char">h</span><span class="char">o</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">w</span><span class="char">e</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">e</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h2></div></div><div class="col-12"><div class="content-wrapper"><p>At Nyati Group, our customers are the soul of our endeavours, shaping the very essence of what we create.</p><p>We immerse ourselves in understanding their aspirations, meticulously transforming expectations into realities that resonate with joy and fulfilment.</p><p>Rooted in an unwavering commitment to integrity and an innate appreciation for aesthetics, we design landmarks that transcend time. Each Nyati project is an ode to sophistication, envisioned with the desires of our patrons at its heart, crafting environments that inspire pride and elevate lifestyles.</p><p>With a diversified presence spanning Real Estate, Hospitality, EPC, Healthcare, and Wellbeing, Nyati Group is a harbinger of transformative milestones. As we journey into uncharted horizons, our pursuit remains steadfast: to redefine excellence and inspire a legacy of innovation.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="leftRight-imgText-sec right-img no-padding-override default-bg team-message-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center page-text-content"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="img-wrapper"><img alt="Chairman&#x27;s Message" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fchairman.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fchairman.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fchairman.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 content-box-left left-side order-last order-lg-first"><div class="text-content"><h3 class="title-text"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">C</span><span class="char">h</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">i</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">m</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">n</span><span class="char">&#x27;</span><span class="char">s</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">M</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">s</span><span class="char">s</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">g</span><span class="char">e</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h3><div class="content-wrapper"><div class="icon"><span style="mask-image:url(/images/icons/quote.png);-webkit-mask-image:url(/images/icons/quote.png)"></span></div><div class="paras">
            <p>
                At Nyati Group, we aspire to be the first choice for all our stakeholders. Be it the quality of our homes or the value they deliver, we at Nyati Group want to give you the assurance of a prosperous future.
            </p>
            <p>
                With us, your dream of owning a quality home is sure to be fulfilled. At Nyati Group, we do not just give you houses; we give you homes. Our quality speaks for itself.
            </p>
            <p>
                Transparency is the cornerstone of all our activities. We do not make tall claims, but we also do not compromise on anything less than what is best for our customers. We want you to experience the same value in living that we see in building each of our projects.
            </p>
            <p>
                We have had a glorious past, and now we march towards excellence, with our customers as the leading light of all that we do.
            </p>
        </div><div class="info-wrapper"><h4 class="name-text">Dr. Nitin Nyati</h4><p>Chairman &amp; Managing Director, Nyati Group</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="leftRight-imgText-sec left-img no-padding-override pt-0 default-bg team-message-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center page-text-content"><div class="col-lg-6 left-side"><div class="img-wrapper"><img alt="Director&#x27;s Message" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fdirector.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fdirector.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fdirector.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 content-box-right"><div class="text-content"><h3 class="title-text"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">D</span><span class="char">i</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">c</span><span class="char">t</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">&#x27;</span><span class="char">s</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">M</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">s</span><span class="char">s</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">g</span><span class="char">e</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h3><div class="content-wrapper"><div class="icon"><span style="mask-image:url(/images/icons/quote.png);-webkit-mask-image:url(/images/icons/quote.png)"></span></div><div class="paras">
                <p>
                    At Nyati Group, we build with numbers as much as with vision. Every
                    project begins with a clear-eyed read of where the market is headed
                    and where global real estate is already ahead of us. We track the
                    innovations, technologies and design shifts shaping cities worldwide,
                    and we bring the best of them home.
                </p>
                <p>
                    For us, growth has always been an informed conviction. We believe in
                    transparency because trust compounds. We believe in innovation because
                    standing still is the costliest decision in this industry. And we
                    believe responsible development is simply good long-term
                    economics.
                </p>
                <p>
                    As a part of the new generation, to take this legacy forward, our
                    commitment is to benchmark ourselves against the best the world has to
                    offer and to keep raising that bar.
                </p>
                <p>
                    At Nyati Group, we are building a company that stays ahead of the
                    curve for our customers who expect nothing less.
                </p>
            </div><div class="info-wrapper"><h4 class="name-text">Mr. Piyush Nyati</h4><p>Joint Managing Director, Nyati Group </p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="teams-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-center align-items-center"><div class="col-12 text-center"><div class="sec--title-wrapper"><h2 class="sec--main-title"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">M</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">n</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">g</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">m</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">n</span><span class="char">t</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">T</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">m</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h2></div></div><div class="col-lg-5 left-side"><div class="content-wrapper"><div class="inner" data-state="active"><h3 class="title-text">Mr. Pranav Nyati</h3><span class="desc">Executive Director, Nyati Group</span><div class="para"><p>Mr. Pranav Nyati has a strong sense of responsibility and purpose. He draws his inspiration from his father, Dr.Nitin Nyati and his brother Piyush Nyati. His amiable demeanour and affable personality make him a natural leader who inspires trust and camaraderie. He has secured BBA and a master’s degree in Business Management & Entrepreneurial Studies from The Indian Business School. He endeavours with a commitment to personal growth, fostering values of integrity, humility, and teamwork. His dynamic approach and commitment to excellence have infused fresh energy into the legacy of Nyati Group. His leadership extends beyond business strategy; he actively seeks to enhance the home-buying experi...</p></div><button class="readmore-btn">Read More</button></div><div class="inner" data-state="inactive"><h3 class="title-text">Dr. Jagdish Hote</h3><span class="desc">Managing Director, Nyati Group</span><div class="para"><p>Since the inception of Nyati Group, the Group has been nurtured by Dr. Jagdish Hote our Managing Director who has a hands on experience of 39 years in construction industry and has received awards from The American Concrete Institute, Indian Concrete Institute and Institution of Engineers. He is an author of a National award wining book on “A to Z of Practical Building Construction & Its Management”. He has received “Bharat Vikas Rattan Award” in 2012 from All India Business Development Association & “Asia Pacific International Award 2013” in Global Achievers Summit, held in Bangkok. Dr. Jagdish Hote is honored by a “DOCTORATE ” in Construction Industry for the subject “Construction Methodol...</p></div><button class="readmore-btn">Read More</button></div><div class="inner" data-state="inactive"><h3 class="title-text">Harish Shroff</h3><span class="desc">Director - Business Development, Nyati Group</span><div class="para"><p>With an illustrious career spanning nearly two decades in the real estate sector, Mr. Harish Shroff is the driving force behind Nyati Group's market leadership and brand evolution. Having joined the organisation in 2000, he has been an integral part of its transformation from a regional player to one of Pune's most respected real estate brands.
        Mr. Harish leads the Group's Sales, Marketing, and Business Development divisions, overseeing strategy, brand positioning, and customer engagement. A graduate of NMIMS, Mumbai, with a Master's degree in Business Management, he brings both academic rigour and market intuition to his role.
        Under his leadership, Nyati has achieved record-...</p></div><button class="readmore-btn">Read More</button></div><div class="inner" data-state="inactive"><h3 class="title-text">Balchandra Hegde</h3><span class="desc">Director - Finance, Nyati Group</span><div class="para"><p>A Chartered Accountant with over three decades of financial expertise, Mr. Balchandra Hegde has been one of the principal architects of Nyati Group's financial strength and stability. Since joining the Group in 2004, he has played a pivotal role in transforming Nyati's financial management systems, enabling its expansion into multiple sectors.
        His contributions span across budgetary control, internal audit systems, MIS implementation, and financial risk management, all of which have established robust fiscal discipline within the organisation. His strategic foresight and analytical acumen have helped Nyati maintain a sound financial ecosystem, even during challenging market cycles.
 ...</p></div><button class="readmore-btn">Read More</button></div><div class="inner" data-state="inactive"><h3 class="title-text">Srinivas Iyer</h3><span class="desc">Director - Land &amp; Legal, Nyati Group</span><div class="para"><p>With over 15 years of experience in the real estate and construction industry, Mr. Srinivas Iyer heads the Land and Legal division at Nyati Group, a role central to the Group's expansion and compliance operations. Since joining Nyati in 2010, he has been instrumental in managing the Group's land acquisition strategy, regulatory affairs, and legal due diligence.
            Mr. Iyer's comprehensive understanding of property law, documentation, and government regulations ensures that every Nyati project is backed by legal integrity and transparency, safeguarding the interests of customers, partners, and stakeholders alike.
            His diligence, foresight, and ethical approach have earned ...</p></div><button class="readmore-btn">Read More</button></div><div class="inner" data-state="inactive"><h3 class="title-text">Mr. D.S. Verma</h3><span class="desc">Director - EPC Projects, Nyati Group</span><div class="para"><p>A highly qualified individual having completed his Civil Engineering in 1987 at Government Technical institute, Lucknow with an expertise of over 38 plus years in building construction, infrastructural development, industrial, commercial, residential & institutional, etc. He has been heading the EPC projects, PAN India and has delivered some major landmarks across the city.
        Under his leadership we have delivered Symbiosis Institute Campus at Pune, Noida, Nagpur, Indore, etc.; Ratnagiri Railway Station, Udaipur Airport, Maharashtra Police Housing, Patanjali Food Park, Ceat Tyres Factory, IT buildings for Capgemini, Asterix Soft, SLK Software, etc.
        His expertise, knowledge and ...</p></div><button class="readmore-btn">Read More</button></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="carousel-wrapper"><div class="swiper teams-carousel"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Mr. Pranav Nyati" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fpranav-nyati.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fpranav-nyati.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fpranav-nyati.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Dr. Jagdish Hote" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fdr-jagdish-hote.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fdr-jagdish-hote.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fdr-jagdish-hote.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Harish Shroff" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fharish-shroff.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fharish-shroff.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fharish-shroff.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Balchandra Hegde" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fbalchandra-hegde.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fbalchandra-hegde.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fbalchandra-hegde.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Srinivas Iyer" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fsrinivas-iyer.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fsrinivas-iyer.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2Fsrinivas-iyer.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Mr. D.S. Verma" loading="lazy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2FDS-Varma.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2FDS-Varma.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fteams%2FDS-Varma.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div></div></div><div class="slider-nav-wrapper"><span class="slide-btn swiper-button-prev" role="button" aria-label="Previous Slide"></span><span class="slide-btn swiper-button-next" role="button" aria-label="Next Slide"></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="vision-mission-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row page-text-content align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-6 left-side"><div class="img-wrapper vision_img"><img alt="" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fvision_1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fvision_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fvision_1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="text-content"><h3 class="title-text">Our Vision</h3><div class="content-wrapper"><p>To be the first choice for all our stakeholders.</p><p>Be it the quality of homes or the value they deliver, at Nyati Group, we aim to offer you the assurance of a prosperous future. With us, your dream of owning a quality home is sure to be fulfilled.</p><p>At Nyati Group, we don’t just build houses - we create homes. Our quality speaks for itself, and transparency is the cornerstone of everything we do. We don’t make lofty claims, but we also never settle for anything less than the best for our customers.</p><p>We want you to experience the value of living, just as we see the value in every project we build. With a glorious past behind us, we now march confidently towards excellence - with our customers as the guiding light in everything we do.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="row page-text-content align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-6 left-side"><div class="text-content"><h3 class="title-text">Our Mission</h3><div class="content-wrapper"><p>Our mission is to create functionally efficient, high-quality landmarks that fulfill the needs of society.</p><p>We are committed to delighting our customers and service providers through a transparent, proactive, assertive, and friendly approach that fosters mutually beneficial relationships.</p><p>We strive to build a trustworthy, competent, and motivated team that is dedicated to following our group’s systems and philosophy, with a continuous focus on improvement.</p></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 order-first order-lg-last"><div class="img-wrapper"><img alt="" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmission.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmission.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fmission.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/></div></div></div></div></section><section class="leftRight-imgText-sec left-img no-padding-override"><div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-between align-items-center page-text-content"><div class="col-lg-6 left-side"><div class="img-wrapper"><img alt="Group Philosophy" width="1920" height="1080" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fgroup-philosophy.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fgroup-philosophy.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fabout-us%2Fgroup-philosophy.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=80"/><span class="img-disc-text">Image for representation purpose only*</span></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 content-box-right"><div class="text-content"><h3 class="title-text"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">G</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">u</span><span class="char">p</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">P</span><span class="char">h</span><span class="char">i</span><span class="char">l</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">s</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">p</span><span class="char">h</span><span class="char">y</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h3><div class="content-wrapper">
            <p>
                <strong>Transparency:</strong> The foundation of brand Nyati is based on the core principle of transparency, which drives all our conduct. We don't believe in holding back from our clients and customers and equally ensure that there is no compromise on the quality of our products. 
            </p>
            <p>
                <strong>Value Creation:</strong> Any product built under the Nyati brand is a landmark you will cherish for life. We ensure there is a consensus between the quality and value you get for the price you pay to buy a Nyati product. We assure you an asset for your investment with us. 
            </p>
            <p>
               <strong>Innovation:</strong> At Nyati Group, our constant endeavour remains to innovate better ways of working together. We value customer feedback, which is incorporated in designing our future projects. 
            </p>
        </div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="awards-sec"><div class="container"><div class="row justify-content-center align-items-center"><div class="col-12 text-center"><div class="sec--title-wrapper"><h2 class="sec--main-title"><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">A</span><span class="char">w</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">r</span><span class="char">d</span><span class="char">s</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">&amp;</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span><span class="words line"><span class="word"><span class="char">A</span><span class="char">c</span><span class="char">c</span><span class="char">o</span><span class="char">l</span><span class="char">a</span><span class="char">d</span><span class="char">e</span><span class="char">s</span></span></span><span class="whitespace"> </span></h2></div></div><div class="col-12 awards-rows"><div class="carousel-wrapper"><div class="swiper awards-carousel style-2"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="award-card"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Award 1" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fawards2%2Faward-01.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fawards2%2Faward-01.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fawards2%2Faward-01.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=80"/></div></div></div><div class="swiper-slide"><div class="award-card"><div class="image-wrapper"><img alt="Award 2" loading="lazy" width="1000" height="1000" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fawards2%2Faward-02.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=80 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fawards2%2Faward-02.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=80 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fawards2%2Faward-02.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=80"/></di