he new generation, to take this legacy forward, our\n                    commitment is to benchmark ourselves against the best the world has to\n                    offer and to keep raising that bar.\n                \u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003e\n                    At Nyati Group, we are building a company that stays ahead of the\n                    curve for our customers who expect nothing less.\n                \u003c/p\u003e\n            "])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$L29\",null,{\"title\":\"About Nyati Group\",\"imageSrc\":\"/images/who-we-are.jpg\",\"imageDisclaimer\":\"Actual Site Photo*\"}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"about-intro-sec\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-12 text-center\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L2a\",null,{\"mainTitle\":\"Who we are\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"content-wrapper\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"At Nyati Group, our customers are the soul of our endeavours, shaping the very essence of what we create.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We immerse ourselves in understanding their aspirations, meticulously transforming expectations into realities that resonate with joy and fulfilment.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Rooted in an unwavering commitment to integrity and an innate appreciation for aesthetics, we design landmarks that transcend time. Each Nyati project is an ode to sophistication, envisioned with the desires of our patrons at its heart, crafting environments that inspire pride and elevate lifestyles.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"With a diversified presence spanning Real Estate, Hospitality, EPC, Healthcare, and Wellbeing, Nyati Group is a harbinger of transformative milestones. As we journey into uncharted horizons, our pursuit remains steadfast: to redefine excellence and inspire a legacy of innovation.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"imagePositionLeft\":false,\"className\":\"default-bg team-message-sec\",\"title\":\"Chairman's Message\",\"para\":\"\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                At Nyati Group, we aspire to be the first choice for all our stakeholders. Be it the quality of our homes or the value they deliver, we at Nyati Group want to give you the assurance of a prosperous future.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                With us, your dream of owning a quality home is sure to be fulfilled. At Nyati Group, we do not just give you houses; we give you homes. Our quality speaks for itself.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                Transparency is the cornerstone of all our activities. We do not make tall claims, but we also do not compromise on anything less than what is best for our customers. We want you to experience the same value in living that we see in building each of our projects.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                We have had a glorious past, and now we march towards excellence, with our customers as the leading light of all that we do.\\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \",\"imageSrc\":\"/images/about-us/chairman.jpg\",\"name\":\"Dr. Nitin Nyati\",\"designation\":\"Chairman \u0026 Managing Director, Nyati Group\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2b\",null,{\"className\":\"pt-0 default-bg team-message-sec\",\"title\":\"Director's Message\",\"para\":\"$2c\",\"imageSrc\":\"/images/about-us/director.jpg\",\"name\":\"Mr. Piyush Nyati\",\"designation\":\"Joint Managing Director, Nyati Group \"}],\"$L2d\",\"$L2e\",\"$L2f\",\"$L30\"],[\"$L31\",\"$L32\",\"$L33\",\"$L34\"],\"$L35\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"36:[]\nb:\"$W36\"\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L37\",null,{\"children\":\"$L38\"}],[\"$\"