tletBoundary\"]\n2d:[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"$L3d\",null,{}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"$L3e\",null,{\"title\":\"Group Philosophy\",\"para\":\"\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                \u003cstrong\u003eTransparency:\u003c/strong\u003e The foundation of brand Nyati is based on the core principle of transparency, which drives all our conduct. We don't believe in holding back from our clients and customers and equally ensure that there is no compromise on the quality of our products. \\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n                \u003cstrong\u003eValue Creation:\u003c/strong\u003e Any product built under the Nyati brand is a landmark you will cherish for life. We ensure there is a consensus between the quality and value you get for the price you pay to buy a Nyati product. We assure you an asset for your investment with us. \\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n            \u003cp\u003e\\n               \u003cstrong\u003eInnovation:\u003c/strong\u003e At Nyati Group, our constant endeavour remains to innovate better ways of working together. We value customer feedback, which is incorporated in designing our future projects. \\n            \u003c/p\u003e\\n        \",\"imageSrc\":\"/images/about-us/group-philosophy.jpg\",\"imageDisclaimer\":\"Image for representation purpose only*\"}]\n30:[\"$\",\"$L3f\",null,{}]\n31:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/12_3y4bu5qbhz.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0nsdmd5n3vwzv.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n33:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-1\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0oeio99z8z6y8.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-2\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/12mdcnxn~ubtc.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"$L40\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$3a\",null,{\"name\":\"N